      "freeText": "Across yesterday's 141-155 (several needed 2 or 3 attempts) and today's 156-160 I enjoy the loop of choosing a colour order, but the game never tells me the order matters or that a bucket's leftover paint stays unusable until the picture changes. Jams feel unfair when buckets are stacked in a column in a fixed order. I would like a visible move count on every win panel (it was missing on the stage boss) and a hint of an 'ideal' number of moves so I know if replaying is worth it. The replay path is awkward: from the map I accidentally opened the next level instead of the one I wanted. The +1 slot button saved me several times."
